<title>USA: Allied Capital vice chairman resigns.</title>
<headline>Allied Capital vice chairman resigns.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Allied Capital Advisers Inc said Friday that David Gladstone had resigned as director and vice chairman of the company.  </p>
<p>Gladstone also resigned as director or manager of the Allied Capital entities, which Allied Capital Corp, it said.</p>
<p>He had stepped down as chairman and chief executive officer in February, it added.</p>
<p>A company spokeswoman said Allied would probably leave the two positions open for a while.</p>
<p>&quot;It's not in any hurry,&quot; she said.</p>
</text>
